  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">APPS: Support to Oran Forum - UNITAR 2025-2028</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project&#x2019;s overall aim is to strengthen coordination, capacities and visibilities of the African Members in the UN Security Council (A3) in championing and promoting common African positions and interests in the UN Security Council (UNSC) decision-making process, through the implementation of the annual High Level Seminar on Peace and Security in Africa: Assisting African Members of the UN Security Council in preparing to address peace and security issues on the Continent (HLS) and the organization of technical meetings. The HLS is organized in collaboration between the African Union Commission (AUC) and UNITAR. The project provides DKK 4.000.000,00 (Four Million Danish kroner) to UNITAR for the period 2025-2028.</narrative>
  </description>
